        "content": {
            "doc-1767286136517": {
                "id": "doc-1767286136517",
                "title": "شرح التركيب",
                "body": "\n        <!-- NEW: Critical Backup Warning -->\n        <div class=\"glass-panel border-r-4 border-yellow-500 rounded-2xl p-0 mb-12 overflow-hidden relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 warning-stripe opacity-30 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-shrink-0\">\n                        <div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border border-yellow-500/30 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(234,179,8,0.2)]\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"alert-triangle\" class=\"w-8 h-8\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            خطوة أمان إجبارية: النسخ الاحتياطي\n                            <span class=\"text-xs bg-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-400 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-yellow-500/20\">هام جداً</span>\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">\n                            قبل البدء في أي عملية تعديل أو تنظيف للكود، <b class=\"text-white\">يجب عليك حفظ نسخة من قالبك الحالي</b>. هذا الإجراء يحميك من فقدان أي أدوات أو أكواد مهمة قد تحتاج للرجوع إليها لاحقاً.\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"bg-black/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-white/5\">\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-yellow-200/90 font-bold mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                <i data-lucide=\"download\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n                                طريقة أخذ النسخة الاحتياطية:\n                            </p>\n                            <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-2 marker:text-yellow-500/50\">\n                                <li>توجه إلى لوحة تحكم بلوجر &larr; <span class=\"text-gray-200\">المظهر (Theme)</span>.</li>\n                                <li>اضغط على السهم الصغير الموجود بجانب زر \"تخصيص\".</li>\n                                <li>اختر <span class=\"text-gray-200\">الاحتفاظ بنسخة احتياطية (Backup)</span> من القائمة.</li>\n                                <li>اضغط على زر <span class=\"text-white bg-blue-600/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs border border-blue-500/30\">تنزيل (Download)</span> لحفظ ملف .xml على جهازك.</li>\n                            </ol>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step 1: Cleaning Code -->\n        <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden group\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-bl-full -mr-8 -mt-8 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-8\">\n                    <span class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl border border-blue-500/20\">1</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white\">تنظيف القالب القديم</h2>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Visual Breadcrumb Steps -->\n                <div class=\"bg-black/20 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 mb-8\">\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 font-bold\">مسار الوصول:</p>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3 md:gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-white/5 hover:border-blue-500/30 transition\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"layout-dashboard\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-300\"></i>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-200\">لوحة التحكم</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <i data-lucide=\"chevron-left\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-600 arrow-flow\"></i>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-white/5 hover:border-blue-500/30 transition\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"palette\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-pink-400\"></i>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-200\">المظهر</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <i data-lucide=\"chevron-left\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-600 arrow-flow\"></i>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-blue-600/20 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-500/50 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(37,99,235,0.2)]\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"code-2\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-400\"></i>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-blue-100\">تعديل HTML</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Detailed Cleaning Instructions -->\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-blue-300 font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"trash-2\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i> طريقة الحذف الصحيحة\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">\n                            داخل محرر الأكواد، اضغط بداخل المربع ثم استخدم اختصار الكيبورد \n                            <kbd class=\"bg-gray-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-white font-mono text-xs mx-1\">Ctrl + A</kbd>\n                            لتحديد كل شيء، ثم اضغط \n                            <kbd class=\"bg-gray-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-white font-mono text-xs mx-1\">Delete</kbd>.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-green-300 font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"clipboard-paste\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i> الخطوة التالية\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">\n                            بعد أن يصبح المربع فارغاً تماماً، انسخ \"كود التنظيف\" الموجود بالأسفل والصقه مكانه، ثم اضغط حفظ.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Code Block -->\n                <div class=\"relative bg-[#0b1120] rounded-xl border border-white/10 overflow-hidden shadow-inner\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-4 py-2 bg-white/5 border-b border-white/5\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono\">clean_code.xml</span>\n                        <button onclick=\"copyToClipboard('cleanCode')\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-blue-400 hover:text-white transition\">\n                            <i data-lucide=\"copy\" class=\"w-3 h-3\"></i> نسخ\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <pre id=\"cleanCode\" class=\"p-4 text-sm font-mono text-green-400 overflow-x-auto selection:bg-green-900/50\">&lt;?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\" ?&gt;\n&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html b:css='false' b:responsive='true' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml' \nxmlns:b='http://www.google.com/2005/gml/b' \nxmlns:data='http://www.google.com/2005/gml/data' \nxmlns:expr='http://www.google.com/2005/gml/expr'&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;&lt;title&gt;Cleaning...&lt;/title&gt;&lt;b:skin&gt;&lt;![CDATA[]]&gt;&lt;/b:skin&gt;&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;&lt;b:section id='main'/&gt;&lt;b:section id='sidebar'/&gt;&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;</pre>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step 2: Install Template -->\n        <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden group\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-purple-500/10 rounded-bl-full -mr-8 -mt-8 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\">\n                <span class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl border border-purple-500/20\">2</span>\n                <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white\">تركيب القالب الجديد</h2>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl border border-white/5\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-1\">1</div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-white\">فتح ملف القالب</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">افتح الملف الذي قمت بتحميله (ينتهي بـ .xml) باستخدام أي محرر نصوص مثل Notepad أو VS Code.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl border border-white/5\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-1\">2</div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-white\">نسخ ولصق</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">انسخ الكود بالكامل، عد إلى بلوجر (مكان كود التنظيف)، امسح كود التنظيف، والصق كود القالب الجديد.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 p-4 rounded-xl mt-4\">\n                    <h4 class=\"text-red-300 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"x-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i> مشكلة شائعة:\n                    </h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-red-100/70\">\n                        إذا ظهر لك خطأ أثناء الحفظ (مثل خطأ XML)، فهذا يعني غالباً أن النسخ لم يكن مكتملاً. تأكد من نسخ الملف من أول سطر إلى آخر سطر.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step 3: Activation -->\n        <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden border-blue-500/30 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(37,99,235,0.1)]\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-600/5 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-center relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-xl shadow-blue-600/20 animate-pulse\">\n                    <i data-lucide=\"shield-check\" class=\"w-10 h-10 text-white\"></i>\n                </div>\n                \n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">تفعيل نسخة القالب</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-300 mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto\">\n                    لضمان عمل جميع خصائص القالب (مثل الوضع الليلي، القوائم المنزلقة، والذكاء الاصطناعي)، يجب ربط المدونة بنظام الترخيص.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex justify-center\">\n                    <button onclick=\"switchView('client-area')\" class=\"nav-link flex items-center gap-3 text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-indigo-700 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-2xl transition-all shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/30 hover:shadow-blue-500/50 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 font-bold cursor-pointer group\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"user-circle\" class=\"w-6 h-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"></i>\n                        <span class=\"font-bold text-lg\">منطقة العملاء</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step 4: Post Installation Settings (New Section) -->\n        <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden group\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-pink-500/10 rounded-bl-full -mr-8 -mt-8 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-8\">\n                <span class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-pink-500/20 text-pink-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl border border-pink-500/20\">3</span>\n                <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white\">إعدادات ما بعد التركيب</h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                <!-- Setting Card 1 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-pink-500/30 transition duration-300\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-pink-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-pink-400 mb-4\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"image\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">ضبط اللوجو (الشعار)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside\">\n                        <li>اذهب إلى <b>التنسيق</b> > ابحث عن أداة <b>Header Logo</b>.</li>\n                        <li>ارفع صورتك (يفضل SVG أو PNG شفافة).</li>\n                        <li>اختر الخيار \"بدلاً من العنوان والوصف\".</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Setting Card 2 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-pink-500/30 transition duration-300\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-pink-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-pink-400 mb-4\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"menu\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">القائمة الرئيسية</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside\">\n                        <li>في <b>التنسيق</b>، ابحث عن <b>Main Menu</b>.</li>\n                        <li>استخدم زر \"إضافة عنصر جديد\" لإضافة الأقسام.</li>\n                        <li>لإنشاء قائمة منسدلة، ابدأ اسم العنصر بـ <code class=\"bg-black/30 px-1 rounded text-xs\">_</code> (مثال: _أخبار).</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Setting Card 3 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-pink-500/30 transition duration-300\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-pink-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-pink-400 mb-4\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"globe\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">أيقونة الموقع (Favicon)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside\">\n                        <li>في أعلى صفحة التنسيق، اضغط \"أيقونة التفضيلات\".</li>\n                        <li>ارفع صورة مربعة (يفضل 100kb أو أقل).</li>\n                        <li>ستظهر هذه الأيقونة في تبويب المتصفح.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Setting Card 4 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-pink-500/30 transition duration-300\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-pink-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-pink-400 mb-4\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"smartphone\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">القائمة السفلية للجوال</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside\">\n                        <li>في التنسيق، ابحث عن <b>Mobile Bottom Menu</b>.</li>\n                        <li>يمكنك تغيير الأيقونات باستخدام أسماء أيقونات SVG.</li>\n                        <li>تأكد من عدم وضع أكثر من 5 عناصر لضمان الشكل الجمالي.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n"
            },
            "doc-1767287681867": {
                "id": "doc-1767287681867",
                "title": "إعدادات الهيدر والقوائم",
                "body": "\n<!-- حاوية المحتوى الرئيسية -->\n<div class=\"doc-wrapper relative mx-auto max-w-5xl space-y-10 p-4 font-sans text-slate-800 antialiased dark:text-slate-100\" dir=\"rtl\">\n\n  <!-- ==========================================\n       SECTION 1: Header Styles (أنماط الهيدر)\n       ========================================== -->\n  <section class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/20 bg-white/40 p-8 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl dark:bg-slate-900/40 dark:border-slate-700/50\">\n    <!-- خلفية جمالية (Glow Effect) -->\n    <div class=\"absolute -left-20 -top-20 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 blur-3xl transition-all duration-700 group-hover:bg-blue-500/20\"></div>\n\n    <!-- العنوان -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 mb-8 flex items-center gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/30\">\n        <i data-lucide=\"palette\" class=\"h-7 w-7 text-white\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-white\">تخصيص الهيدر</h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-1 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\">تحكم في مظهر رأس الصفحة بلمسة واحدة</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- خطوات التفعيل -->\n    <div class=\"mb-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/50 bg-white/30 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm dark:bg-slate-800/30 dark:border-slate-700\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"settings-2\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"></i>\n          مسار التعديل\n        </h3>\n        <ol class=\"relative mr-4 space-y-4 border-r border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900\">\n          <li class=\"mr-6\">\n            <span class=\"absolute -mr-[33px] flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-100 ring-4 ring-white dark:bg-indigo-900 dark:ring-slate-800\">1</span>\n            <p>توجه إلى <b>التخطيط (Layout)</b> في لوحة التحكم.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"mr-6\">\n            <span class=\"absolute -mr-[33px] flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-100 ring-4 ring-white dark:bg-indigo-900 dark:ring-slate-800\">2</span>\n            <p>ابحث عن أداة <b>\"🎨 شكل الهيدر\"</b> واضغط تعديل.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"mr-6\">\n            <span class=\"absolute -mr-[33px] flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white ring-4 ring-white dark:ring-slate-800\">3</span>\n            <p>في حقل الرابط (URL) للعنصر <code class=\"rounded bg-indigo-50 px-2 py-1 text-sm font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-indigo-400\">style</code>، اكتب الرقم المختار.</p>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- المعاينة البصرية للأنماط -->\n      <div class=\"grid gap-3\">\n        <!-- Style 0 -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 transition-all hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800/50\">\n          <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-slate-200 text-2xl font-black text-slate-600 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">0</div>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200\">الشكل الافتراضي (الموجي)</span>\n            <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-500\">تصميم نظيف وعصري يناسب المدونات العامة.</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Style 1 -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-red-100 bg-red-50/50 p-4 transition-all hover:border-red-400 hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800/50\">\n          <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-red-100 text-2xl font-black text-red-500 dark:bg-red-900/30\">1</div>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"block font-bold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400\">الشكل الإخباري</span>\n            <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-500\">ألوان حادة (أحمر/أبيض) لجذب الانتباه للأخبار العاجلة.</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Style 2 -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-sky-100 bg-sky-50/50 p-4 transition-all hover:border-sky-400 hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800/50\">\n          <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sky-100 text-2xl font-black text-sky-600 dark:bg-sky-900/30\">2</div>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"block font-bold text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400\">الشكل التقني</span>\n            <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-500\">طابع رسمي (أزرق/كحلي) للمواقع التقنية والشركات.</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ==========================================\n       SECTION 2: Main Menu (القائمة الرئيسية)\n       ========================================== -->\n  <section class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/20 bg-white/40 p-8 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl dark:bg-slate-900/40 dark:border-slate-700/50\">\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 mb-8 flex items-center gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/30\">\n        <i data-lucide=\"list-tree\" class=\"h-7 w-7 text-white\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-white\">هيكلة القوائم</h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-1 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\">بناء القوائم المنسدلة والميجا منيو المتقدمة</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2\">\n      \n      <!-- Card: Dropdown Menu -->\n      <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/50 p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-900/5 dark:bg-slate-800/50 dark:ring-white/10\">\n        <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"chevron-down-circle\" class=\"text-emerald-500\"></i>\n          1. القائمة المنسدلة (Dropdown)\n        </h3>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">لإنشاء رابط فرعي يظهر تحت رابط آخر، كل ما عليك هو إضافة شرطة سفلية <code class=\"font-bold text-emerald-600\">_</code> قبل الاسم.</p>\n        \n        <!-- Code Visual -->\n        <div class=\"mt-6 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 p-4 font-mono text-sm text-slate-300 shadow-inner\">\n          <div class=\"mb-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">ترتيب الأداة في التخطيط:</div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">●</span> الرئيسية</div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">●</span> أقسام الموقع</div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pl-4 text-emerald-400\">\n             <span class=\"opacity-50\">↳</span> _تطبيقات\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pl-4 text-emerald-400\">\n             <span class=\"opacity-50\">↳</span> _ألعاب\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Card: Mega Menu -->\n      <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50/50 to-teal-50/50 p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-emerald-900/10 dark:from-emerald-900/10 dark:to-teal-900/10 dark:ring-emerald-500/20\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"layout-grid\" class=\"text-emerald-500\"></i>\n            2. الميجا منيو (Mega Menu)\n            </h3>\n            <span class=\"rounded-full bg-red-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-red-600 dark:bg-red-900/50 dark:text-red-300\">ميزة حصرية 🔥</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">لعرض آخر المقالات مصورة داخل القائمة.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"mt-4 space-y-3\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg bg-white/60 p-3 shadow-sm dark:bg-slate-800/60\">\n                <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded bg-emerald-100 font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-300\">1</span>\n                <div>\n                    <span class=\"block text-xs text-slate-500\">خانة اسم الموقع</span>\n                    <code class=\"font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">[mega] التسمية</code>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg bg-white/60 p-3 shadow-sm dark:bg-slate-800/60\">\n                <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded bg-emerald-100 font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-300\">2</span>\n                <div>\n                    <span class=\"block text-xs text-slate-500\">خانة الرابط (URL)</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-medium\">رابط التصنيف أو #</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-md bg-yellow-50 p-3 text-sm text-yellow-800 dark:bg-yellow-900/20 dark:text-yellow-200\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"alert-circle\" class=\"mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0\"></i>\n            <p>تنبيه: يجب أن يكون الاسم بعد [mega] مطابقاً تماماً لاسم التسمية (Label) في مقالاتك.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ==========================================\n       SECTION 3: News Ticker (شريط الأخبار)\n       ========================================== -->\n  <section class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/20 bg-white/40 p-8 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl dark:bg-slate-900/40 dark:border-slate-700/50\">\n    <div class=\"absolute -right-20 bottom-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 blur-3xl transition-all duration-700 group-hover:bg-purple-500/20\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 mb-8 flex items-center gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-fuchsia-600 shadow-lg shadow-purple-500/30\">\n        <i data-lucide=\"newspaper\" class=\"h-7 w-7 text-white\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-white\">إعدادات شريط الأخبار</h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-1 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\">تعديل سلوك ومظهر شريط \"عاجل\" المتحرك</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Configuration Cards Grid (Instead of Table) -->\n    <div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\">\n        <!-- Config Item 1 -->\n        <div class=\"group/card relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 text-center shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 dark:bg-purple-900/30 dark:text-purple-300\">\n                <i data-lucide=\"paint-bucket\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"font-mono text-lg font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200\">style</h4>\n            <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500\">يتحكم في المظهر العام</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-4 rounded bg-slate-100 py-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200\">القيم: 1 إلى 5</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Config Item 2 -->\n        <div class=\"group/card relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 text-center shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800\">\n             <div class=\"mx-auto mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 dark:bg-purple-900/30 dark:text-purple-300\">\n                <i data-lucide=\"type\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"font-mono text-lg font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200\">title</h4>\n            <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500\">العنوان الجانبي للشريط</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-4 rounded bg-slate-100 py-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200\">مثال: \"عاجل\" أو \"جديدنا\"</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Config Item 3 -->\n        <div class=\"group/card relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 text-center shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800\">\n             <div class=\"mx-auto mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 dark:bg-purple-900/30 dark:text-purple-300\">\n                <i data-lucide=\"calculator\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"font-mono text-lg font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200\">count</h4>\n            <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500\">عدد الأخبار المعروضة</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-4 rounded bg-slate-100 py-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200\">القيمة: رقم (مثال: 5)</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</div>\n"
            }
        }
    }
]
